{{define "content"}}
<hgroup>
    <h1>Certs</h1>
    <p>Reading <code>{{.Detected.Sshca}}</code>'s issuance log + KRL.</p>
</hgroup>

<article>
    <header><strong>v0.0.1 scaffold</strong></header>
    <p>This view will render the JSONL audit log as a sortable table: KEY_ID, principals, valid-from, valid-until, status (active / expiring / expired / revoked), issuer.</p>
    <p>Actions: click-to-revoke (shells out to <code>sshca cert revoke</code>), click-to-renew (shells out to <code>sshca cert renew --ship ...</code>), click-to-inspect (modal with <code>ssh-keygen -L</code> output).</p>
    <p><em>Coming in v0.1.</em></p>
</article>
{{end}}
